'''Akane Tendo''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 597
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Akane Tendo
|name2 = Akane Tendo (Gi)
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Akane Tendo (Gi)''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Akane Tendo is essentially an Uber version of [[Talents|talented]] [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]. She has a 30% chance to perform [[Savage Blow|Savage Blows]] and similar range to Housewife Cat.

She has relatively average standing range, 250 piercing range, and a blindspot of 250. However, one aspect that makes her stand out is [[Barrier Breaker]], having a similar utility to [[Aer (Uber Rare Cat)|Aer's]]. She has an average DPS of 5.7k through Savage Blow, which is the standard for many [[Long Distance]] Ubers of her kind. Compared to [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] as well as [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs & Minka]], she eclipses both of them in terms of raw damage output, but quickly falls off once their True Forms are obtained. Other Long Distance units such as [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Storm Beast Naala]] also tend to overshadow due to their more expansive kits and wider utilities.

Regardless, her many debuff immunities allow her to work as a generalist attacker in situations where other units wouldn't work, like with stages that feature [[Croakley]] or [[Henry]]. Her [[Immune to Knockback|Immunity to Knockback]] can occasionally hinder her ability to reposition, but her stagger thresholds are already to the point where any amount of damage will cause a natural knockback.

So while never the best option, she's always one that works.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Breaker}}

